1
00:00:00,920 --> 00:00:02,090
(Sheldon:)Rajesh?

2
00:00:04,132 --> 00:00:08,632
Uh, he says he's having trouble
dropping those Iast five pounds.

3
00:00:09,178 --> 00:00:12,428
(Mrs Cooper:)Huh. I might have gone
with the talking-to-girls thing.

4
00:00:14,142 --> 00:00:16,062
(Howard:)No, you only get one wish.

5
00:00:33,953 --> 00:00:36,243
(Sheldon:)Look at the two of us.

6
00:00:36,789 --> 00:00:39,959
(Sheldon:)Me, a highly regarded physicist.

7
00:00:40,376 --> 00:00:44,126
(Sheldon:)The kind of mind that comes along once,
maybe twice in a generation.

8
00:00:44,297 --> 00:00:46,627
(Sheldon:)You, the common man...

9
00:00:46,799 --> 00:00:50,139
...tired from your labors
as a stockbroker...

10
00:00:50,303 --> 00:00:54,223
(Sheldon:)...or vacuum cleaner salesman,
or bootblack.

11
00:00:56,225 --> 00:00:58,645
(Sheldon:)But deep down inside...

